    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legal duty on local authorities to ensure sufficient road crossings near schools",
        "additional_details": "We believe those going to and from school should have good safety when needing to cross the road.",
        "background": "The Government must place a legal duty on local councils to make sure roads have sufficient crossings, such as traffic lights or zebra crossings, within a reasonable distance to the schools.",
